1
00:00:38,440 --> 00:00:40,800
[Her Willing Subject]

2
00:00:40,920 --> 00:00:43,680
[Episode 3]

3
00:00:46,880 --> 00:00:47,670
Wonderful.

4
00:00:47,790 --> 00:00:51,350
Qingcang is considerate,
Shuying sincere.

5
00:00:51,350 --> 00:00:52,640
A match made in heaven.

6
00:01:12,480 --> 00:01:13,120
Shuying.

7
00:01:13,350 --> 00:01:14,150
Ying'er.

8
00:01:14,560 --> 00:01:15,350
Shuying.

9
00:01:15,870 --> 00:01:16,680
Shuying.

10
00:01:17,000 --> 00:01:18,000
Bone-Eroding Powder.

11
00:01:18,400 --> 00:01:19,590
Quick, summon the imperial physician!

12
00:01:19,590 --> 00:01:20,200
Hurry!

13
00:01:20,200 --> 00:01:21,480
Take her to my palace first.

14
00:01:21,480 --> 00:01:22,560
It is the closest.

15
00:01:22,640 --> 00:01:24,350
Then I must trouble Your Highness.

16
00:01:27,950 --> 00:01:29,870
Ying'er! Ying'er!

17
00:01:32,000 --> 00:01:32,790
This is bad.

18
00:01:33,280 --> 00:01:34,590
If the Bone-Eroding Powder
is not neutralized in time,

19
00:01:34,840 --> 00:01:35,760
the consequences will be grave.

20
00:01:36,070 --> 00:01:37,710
Chancellor Shen, I leave her to you.

21
00:01:47,200 --> 00:01:49,280
Zhuren, where did you put the antidote
for the Bone-Eroding Powder?

22
00:01:49,760 --> 00:01:51,590
Young Master, why save Miss Shen?

23
00:01:51,590 --> 00:01:52,640
Weren't you trying to kill her?

24
00:01:52,640 --> 00:01:54,280
Today I was only testing her.

25
00:01:54,560 --> 00:01:55,760
I got the answer I wanted.

26
00:01:56,150 --> 00:01:58,150
So of course I will not let her die.

27
00:01:58,560 --> 00:02:00,350
But you two have barely met.

28
00:02:01,000 --> 00:02:02,790
What love-hate tangle lies
between you?

29
00:02:04,200 --> 00:02:05,000
You dare ask?

30
00:02:05,400 --> 00:02:06,400
I have not even scolded you yet.

31
00:02:07,200 --> 00:02:08,430
Today was only a test.

32
00:02:08,430 --> 00:02:09,710
Who told you to actually poison her?

33
00:02:10,120 --> 00:02:12,080
I... I did not poison her.

34
00:02:14,000 --> 00:02:14,910
You did not poison her?

35
00:02:15,590 --> 00:02:17,030
I thought you had changed your mind

36
00:02:17,030 --> 00:02:18,150
and poisoned her yourself.

37
00:02:21,360 --> 00:02:22,150
Young Master.

38
00:02:30,190 --> 00:02:31,630
The Bone-Eroding Powder is untouched.

39
00:02:32,150 --> 00:02:33,030
It has not been used.

40
00:02:33,800 --> 00:02:35,590
Then what poison did Miss Shen take?

41
00:02:36,800 --> 00:02:38,190
She has fooled me again.

42
00:02:46,710 --> 00:02:47,520
Miss Shen.

43
00:02:47,680 --> 00:02:48,560
Well done.

44
00:02:51,840 --> 00:02:53,560
I will bring His Highness in

45
00:02:53,630 --> 00:02:55,680
and tell him you have recovered.

46
00:02:55,680 --> 00:02:56,430
Thank you.

47
00:02:59,280 --> 00:03:00,030
My Lady.

48
00:03:00,030 --> 00:03:01,560
Good thing you had the foresight

49
00:03:01,590 --> 00:03:02,710
to have me switch the wine

50
00:03:02,710 --> 00:03:04,000
prepared by General Lu on the way.

51
00:03:04,680 --> 00:03:06,400
But how did you know

52
00:03:06,400 --> 00:03:08,870
General Lu would prepare poisoned
wine to test you?

53
00:03:09,710 --> 00:03:11,240
I know him best.

54
00:03:11,240 --> 00:03:12,280
The man is

55
00:03:12,400 --> 00:03:14,870
stubborn, rigid, and methodical.

56
00:03:15,910 --> 00:03:18,280
In his last life, he lost everything
due to the Bone-Eroding Powder,

57
00:03:18,280 --> 00:03:19,120
even his life.

58
00:03:19,470 --> 00:03:21,430
In this life,
he will surely repay it in kind

59
00:03:21,680 --> 00:03:23,430
and want me to drink that poison too.

60
00:03:23,430 --> 00:03:25,590
However, Lu Qingcang,

61
00:03:26,080 --> 00:03:27,360
if you want to fight me,

62
00:03:27,800 --> 00:03:29,150
we are well matched,

63
00:03:29,240 --> 00:03:30,360
but you are one move behind.

64
00:03:37,590 --> 00:03:39,030
The court is full of prying eyes.

65
00:03:39,080 --> 00:03:40,080
Please forgive me

66
00:03:40,080 --> 00:03:42,030
for using such an underhanded means.

67
00:03:42,560 --> 00:03:43,870
Greetings, Your Highness.

68
00:03:47,150 --> 00:03:47,960
Speak.

69
00:03:48,590 --> 00:03:50,400
You took such a long way to reach me.

70
00:03:52,000 --> 00:03:53,240
What is your aim?

71
00:03:56,470 --> 00:03:57,280
Marry me.

72
00:03:57,680 --> 00:03:58,910
I will help you take the throne.

73
00:03:59,150 --> 00:04:00,360
And you will make me Empress.

74
00:04:03,000 --> 00:04:04,680
You are Lu Qingcang's betrothed.

75
00:04:04,840 --> 00:04:07,120
And I am negotiating a match with
General Wei's daughter.

76
00:04:07,120 --> 00:04:08,560
What absurd words are these?

77
00:04:09,030 --> 00:04:11,150
Break off the match with General Wei.

78
00:04:11,360 --> 00:04:13,030
I am the one who should be your wife.

79
00:04:18,120 --> 00:04:19,750
The Lu residence is likely unsafe now.

80
00:04:21,680 --> 00:04:23,270
All was well. What happened?

81
00:04:23,310 --> 00:04:24,920
Shen Shuying has met the Eighth Prince.

82
00:04:25,160 --> 00:04:26,720
Her next step is to strike back at us.

83
00:04:27,680 --> 00:04:28,680
So what?

84
00:04:28,720 --> 00:04:29,750
You are a hero of the realm,

85
00:04:29,800 --> 00:04:31,270
and Empress Lu's nephew.

86
00:04:31,600 --> 00:04:33,600
Could one meeting let her turn the tide?

87
00:04:33,600 --> 00:04:36,390
Normally, that could never happen.

88
00:04:36,560 --> 00:04:38,160
But if she has been reborn,

89
00:04:39,120 --> 00:04:40,830
she must know that secret.

90
00:04:41,480 --> 00:04:42,270
Secret?

91
00:04:43,000 --> 00:04:43,870
What secret?

92
00:04:43,920 --> 00:04:44,920
The secret

93
00:04:44,920 --> 00:04:48,240
that will make Xiao Ningze back her.

94
00:04:48,480 --> 00:04:49,800
You are indeed beautiful.

95
00:04:49,870 --> 00:04:51,800
And I am indeed interested in you.

96
00:04:51,800 --> 00:04:53,360
If I do take the throne one day,

97
00:04:53,600 --> 00:04:54,600
making you a consort

98
00:04:54,630 --> 00:04:55,800
would not be impossible.

99
00:04:55,830 --> 00:04:56,630
However,

100
00:04:57,920 --> 00:05:00,240
you keep asking for
the position of Empress.

101
00:05:00,510 --> 00:05:03,310
That pretty head may not stay
on your shoulders.

102
00:05:05,800 --> 00:05:07,600
Wei Chengjun, the Mighty General,

103
00:05:07,630 --> 00:05:08,680
commands the army.

104
00:05:08,680 --> 00:05:09,950
His achievements rival the throne.

105
00:05:10,000 --> 00:05:11,070
He is wildly ambitious.

106
00:05:11,270 --> 00:05:12,720
If you marry his daughter,

107
00:05:13,070 --> 00:05:14,510
you will only be his puppet

108
00:05:14,830 --> 00:05:16,270
and gain nothing by it.

109
00:05:19,240 --> 00:05:20,040
So

110
00:05:20,430 --> 00:05:21,240
what makes you think

111
00:05:21,240 --> 00:05:23,390
I would marry a woman I've just met?

112
00:05:24,480 --> 00:05:26,190
It is not too late to start
getting to know each other now.

113
00:05:26,190 --> 00:05:29,000
Besides, I am the Chancellor's daughter.

114
00:05:29,000 --> 00:05:30,920
My standing is hardly lowly.

115
00:05:32,480 --> 00:05:33,720
A mere Chancellor's house

116
00:05:33,870 --> 00:05:35,310
is beneath my notice.

117
00:05:35,310 --> 00:05:36,950
Precisely because you are a prince,

118
00:05:36,950 --> 00:05:38,830
I am offering you this bargain.

119
00:05:40,430 --> 00:05:43,390
I am the only son of the Emperor
of Dasheng,

120
00:05:43,390 --> 00:05:45,600
and the future emperor of Dasheng.

121
00:05:45,600 --> 00:05:47,390
Do I need your help to take the throne?

122
00:05:54,120 --> 00:05:55,190
Why are you laughing?

123
00:05:56,360 --> 00:05:57,560
Let me tell you something.

124
00:05:58,000 --> 00:06:00,040
His Majesty has more than one son.

125
00:06:01,630 --> 00:06:02,480
What did you say?

126
00:06:03,510 --> 00:06:05,560
His Majesty has long been frail,

127
00:06:05,870 --> 00:06:07,630
and you are his only son,

128
00:06:07,630 --> 00:06:09,480
yet he never names you Crown Prince.

129
00:06:09,600 --> 00:06:11,750
The whole court keeps petitioning him,

130
00:06:11,750 --> 00:06:13,360
yet His Majesty will not relent.

131
00:06:13,830 --> 00:06:14,750
Your Highness,

132
00:06:15,390 --> 00:06:17,950
have you never wondered why?

133
00:06:23,720 --> 00:06:25,040
This is the answer.

134
00:06:25,430 --> 00:06:27,480
His Majesty does not intend to
leave you the throne.

135
00:06:27,510 --> 00:06:28,360
Shen Shuying,

136
00:06:28,920 --> 00:06:30,720
spreading rumors is a capital crime.
It costs your head.

137
00:06:32,510 --> 00:06:34,870
His Majesty has issued the true
succession edict.

138
00:06:35,000 --> 00:06:36,560
You can't see its contents,

139
00:06:37,000 --> 00:06:40,000
but the Imperial Household Department
records when it was issued.

140
00:06:40,040 --> 00:06:41,870
Proving the secret edict exists

141
00:06:43,480 --> 00:06:45,190
should not be hard for you, should it?

142
00:06:46,870 --> 00:06:48,000
How do you know this?

143
00:06:48,000 --> 00:06:49,310
It seems Your Highness

144
00:06:50,000 --> 00:06:52,310
is not unfamiliar with this edict.

145
00:06:54,190 --> 00:06:55,510
There is indeed a secret edict.

146
00:06:55,920 --> 00:06:56,720
Only,

147
00:06:56,870 --> 00:06:58,480
I did not know it was a succession
edict.

148
00:06:58,480 --> 00:06:59,430
And I never imagined

149
00:06:59,560 --> 00:07:00,950
that I have a brother.

150
00:07:01,480 --> 00:07:03,120
I can help you find that man,

151
00:07:03,270 --> 00:07:05,560
and make you Crown Prince of Dasheng,

152
00:07:05,560 --> 00:07:06,870
the future emperor.

153
00:07:16,630 --> 00:07:17,920
Do you truly want

154
00:07:18,800 --> 00:07:20,950
to be a puppet all your life?

155
00:07:21,240 --> 00:07:22,270
Shen Shuying, you...

156
00:07:25,920 --> 00:07:26,720
It seems

157
00:07:26,870 --> 00:07:29,240
you're not only beautiful,
but also very clever.

158
00:07:29,480 --> 00:07:30,920
I will request the decree at once,

159
00:07:30,920 --> 00:07:32,430
and ask for your hand at the
Chancellor's house.

160
00:07:32,950 --> 00:07:34,360
I have one condition.

161
00:07:37,240 --> 00:07:38,040
Speak.

162
00:07:40,430 --> 00:07:43,390
Lu Qingcang's life is mine to deal with.

163
00:07:44,480 --> 00:07:45,510
Such a trivial matter.

164
00:07:45,510 --> 00:07:46,120
No need to tell me.

165
00:07:51,800 --> 00:07:55,070
Lu Qingcang, you have killed me
so many times.

166
00:07:55,360 --> 00:07:57,240
Now it is your turn to die.

167
00:08:01,830 --> 00:08:03,240
The Eighth Prince has a brother,

168
00:08:03,240 --> 00:08:04,560
and His Majesty favors him?

169
00:08:04,600 --> 00:08:05,800
Then the struggle for the throne

170
00:08:05,800 --> 00:08:07,040
will be full of hidden currents.

171
00:08:07,040 --> 00:08:08,360
Let's talk about this later.

172
00:08:08,510 --> 00:08:09,360
Staying alive comes first.

173
00:08:31,390 --> 00:08:32,200
Zhuren,

174
00:08:32,630 --> 00:08:33,720
fight our way out with me!

175
00:08:33,870 --> 00:08:35,360
I, Lu Qingcang, am not fated to die!

176
00:09:08,790 --> 00:09:10,150
Seeing me alive,

177
00:09:10,240 --> 00:09:11,670
untouched by the Bone-Eroding Powder,

178
00:09:11,840 --> 00:09:12,960
you must be disappointed.

179
00:09:13,320 --> 00:09:14,840
So you really were reborn.

180
00:09:16,390 --> 00:09:17,600
You only see it now?

181
00:09:17,720 --> 00:09:18,600
Too late.

182
00:09:22,510 --> 00:09:24,000
You lost last time as well.

183
00:09:24,240 --> 00:09:25,200
This time,

184
00:09:25,600 --> 00:09:26,960
you may not win either.

185
00:09:27,910 --> 00:09:28,550
No.

186
00:09:29,720 --> 00:09:31,600
Last time, I was the one who killed you.

187
00:09:32,150 --> 00:09:33,150
This time,

188
00:09:34,270 --> 00:09:35,910
I can kill you again.

189
00:09:37,750 --> 00:09:39,790
With these worthless assassins?

190
00:09:45,790 --> 00:09:46,600
Wait.

191
00:09:47,670 --> 00:09:49,720
Worthy of the Regent you were
in your last life.

192
00:09:49,870 --> 00:09:52,600
You survive even a net cast
for you.

193
00:09:54,670 --> 00:09:56,080
Since I am still alive,

194
00:09:56,120 --> 00:09:57,870
your scheme will not work.

195
00:09:58,320 --> 00:10:00,840
Assassinating a court official is
a capital crime.

196
00:10:03,270 --> 00:10:04,360
What did you say?

197
00:10:05,120 --> 00:10:05,960
A capital crime?

198
00:10:07,320 --> 00:10:08,670
The difference between you and me:

199
00:10:08,670 --> 00:10:09,630
you may underestimate me,

200
00:10:09,630 --> 00:10:11,510
but I have never underestimated you.

201
00:10:21,200 --> 00:10:22,600
[Imperial Edict: Border Defense]

202
00:10:25,440 --> 00:10:26,390
Border defense?

203
00:10:26,390 --> 00:10:27,390
Depart at once.

204
00:10:27,790 --> 00:10:30,360
Any delay means death.

205
00:10:31,120 --> 00:10:32,480
You're playing dirty.

206
00:10:32,960 --> 00:10:34,080
With your abilities,

207
00:10:34,080 --> 00:10:35,960
I cannot kill you quickly.

208
00:10:36,030 --> 00:10:37,510
But with this edict,

209
00:10:37,510 --> 00:10:39,200
the moment you appear in the capital,

210
00:10:39,270 --> 00:10:40,550
it is a capital crime.

211
00:10:41,440 --> 00:10:43,600
Countless eyes will watch you for me.

212
00:10:44,550 --> 00:10:46,600
What waves can you stir?

213
00:10:47,480 --> 00:10:49,000
Do you want me dead that badly?

214
00:10:49,000 --> 00:10:51,080
You are the one who tried to
kill me again and again.

215
00:10:51,440 --> 00:10:52,630
How could you ask me that?

216
00:10:52,840 --> 00:10:54,270
I find it absurd.

217
00:11:00,080 --> 00:11:00,870
Stand down.

218
00:11:01,200 --> 00:11:02,670
None of you is his match.

219
00:11:06,630 --> 00:11:07,790
Say what you have to say.

220
00:11:08,150 --> 00:11:09,480
What other tricks do you have?

221
00:11:10,670 --> 00:11:12,320
That arrow at the Music Bureau
was a misunderstanding.

222
00:11:12,960 --> 00:11:14,120
And that cup of tea,

223
00:11:14,120 --> 00:11:15,550
I did not actually poison it.

224
00:11:17,910 --> 00:11:19,240
I did underestimate you.

225
00:11:19,440 --> 00:11:20,320
I admit I lost.

226
00:11:20,630 --> 00:11:22,240
But you have to give me an answer.

227
00:11:24,960 --> 00:11:25,840
What answer?

228
00:11:26,440 --> 00:11:28,510
Heaven has given us a chance to
start over.

229
00:11:28,720 --> 00:11:31,390
So can we... start again?

230
00:11:34,510 --> 00:11:35,720
The border is far.

231
00:11:35,720 --> 00:11:37,000
Depart at once.

232
00:11:37,630 --> 00:11:39,360
I am to marry the Eighth Prince.

233
00:11:39,630 --> 00:11:40,720
I will not see you off.

234
00:11:41,150 --> 00:11:42,150
In this life,

235
00:11:42,270 --> 00:11:43,440
let us never meet again.

236
00:11:50,270 --> 00:11:51,360
That scum Xiao Ningze,

237
00:11:51,360 --> 00:11:52,600
you still want to marry him again?

238
00:11:53,440 --> 00:11:55,360
He is the Eighth Prince, the
future emperor.

239
00:11:55,360 --> 00:11:56,320
If I do not marry him,

240
00:11:56,320 --> 00:11:57,510
how can I rise higher?

241
00:11:57,600 --> 00:11:59,750
You still choose power over me.

242
00:11:59,910 --> 00:12:01,910
Do not forget, in our last life we
both died miserably.

243
00:12:01,910 --> 00:12:03,440
The one who made me
die miserably was you.

244
00:12:04,870 --> 00:12:05,670
Fine.

245
00:12:06,440 --> 00:12:07,510
You may kill me

246
00:12:07,630 --> 00:12:08,630
or keep fighting me.

247
00:12:09,030 --> 00:12:10,360
But the mistake of our last life,

248
00:12:10,360 --> 00:12:11,790
the one I least want you to repeat,

249
00:12:11,790 --> 00:12:12,840
is marrying him.

250
00:12:13,840 --> 00:12:14,440
No.

251
00:12:14,720 --> 00:12:16,030
The mistake of our last life,

252
00:12:16,510 --> 00:12:18,080
the one I least want to repeat,

253
00:12:18,630 --> 00:12:20,240
is being entangled with you.

254
00:12:24,030 --> 00:12:25,320
You hate me that much?

255
00:12:25,510 --> 00:12:26,320
Yes.

256
00:12:30,790 --> 00:12:31,790
And if I

257
00:12:32,120 --> 00:12:33,510
still want to stay entangled?

258
00:12:38,480 --> 00:12:39,790
You will not get the chance.

259
00:12:58,550 --> 00:12:59,390
Shen Shuying.

260
00:13:00,200 --> 00:13:01,480
Since you will not concede,

261
00:13:01,840 --> 00:13:03,080
neither will I.

262
00:13:18,030 --> 00:13:19,150
You're fully recovered now?

263
00:13:19,150 --> 00:13:21,390
How is your bond with Qingcang?

264
00:13:21,960 --> 00:13:23,440
The wedding is indeed near.

265
00:13:23,840 --> 00:13:24,630
Good.

266
00:13:25,000 --> 00:13:25,910
Wonderful.

267
00:13:26,200 --> 00:13:29,120
For twenty years I have waited
for this day.

268
00:13:29,200 --> 00:13:30,200
My wish is fulfilled.

269
00:13:31,270 --> 00:13:31,910
Father,

270
00:13:31,960 --> 00:13:33,080
why are you so determined

271
00:13:33,080 --> 00:13:34,390
to marry me to Lu Qingcang?

272
00:13:36,720 --> 00:13:37,910
It is a secret.

273
00:13:38,150 --> 00:13:39,600
On the day you are wed,

274
00:13:39,840 --> 00:13:41,550
I will tell you both.

275
00:13:43,360 --> 00:13:44,750
I fear that day will never come.

276
00:13:46,550 --> 00:13:47,200
Father,

277
00:13:47,600 --> 00:13:49,440
what I mean to become is the
Eighth Prince's consort,

278
00:13:49,480 --> 00:13:51,320
the future empress of Dasheng.

279
00:13:51,480 --> 00:13:53,840
Only then can I shelter the Shen family,

280
00:13:53,840 --> 00:13:55,630
and keep it standing through the storm.

281
00:13:56,200 --> 00:13:57,440
Your old friend's kindness,

282
00:13:57,840 --> 00:13:59,440
I fear I cannot repay for you.

283
00:14:00,360 --> 00:14:01,320
Impossible.

284
00:14:01,630 --> 00:14:04,030
The Eighth Prince has always been
close to General Wei.

285
00:14:04,030 --> 00:14:05,360
How could he marry you?

286
00:14:05,870 --> 00:14:08,480
Besides, Consort Shu would never agree.

287
00:14:13,000 --> 00:14:14,790
Mother, my mind is made up.

288
00:14:14,910 --> 00:14:17,080
I will never marry
General Wei's daughter.

289
00:14:20,800 --> 00:14:23,550
[Su Shentang, Consort Shu of Dasheng]

290
00:14:23,550 --> 00:14:25,280
But that is Wei Chengjun!

291
00:14:25,520 --> 00:14:27,880
His merit overshadows the throne;
he commands a great army.

292
00:14:28,120 --> 00:14:31,400
Even your father must show him
some respect.

293
00:14:31,880 --> 00:14:33,400
That's exactly why I must not marry her.

294
00:14:33,640 --> 00:14:35,430
He already rides roughshod over us.

295
00:14:35,430 --> 00:14:36,430
Once he becomes the
emperor's father-in-law,

296
00:14:36,430 --> 00:14:38,160
there will be no place left
for us mother and son.

297
00:14:38,550 --> 00:14:39,670
Even if I became Emperor,

298
00:14:39,670 --> 00:14:40,760
what would be the point?

299
00:14:43,280 --> 00:14:44,480
You insolent boy!

300
00:15:05,030 --> 00:15:09,240
♪Moonlight spills over your hand
that holds the lantern♪

301
00:15:09,800 --> 00:15:14,010
♪Light and shadow chase
across the red wall♪

302
00:15:14,440 --> 00:15:18,640
♪Past entanglements,
how do we settle the score♪

303
00:15:19,140 --> 00:15:21,230
♪If fate turns once more♪

304
00:15:21,610 --> 00:15:24,070
♪Will our endings trade places♪

305
00:15:24,300 --> 00:15:28,980
♪Restraint or drawing near♪

306
00:15:29,090 --> 00:15:33,180
♪Tugging back and forth
between two hearts in resonance♪

307
00:15:33,720 --> 00:15:37,240
♪What tone should I take♪

308
00:15:37,340 --> 00:15:40,340
♪To leave no trace♪

309
00:15:40,480 --> 00:15:42,930
♪How can I keep my head clear♪

310
00:15:43,320 --> 00:15:47,650
♪But the moment you come close♪

311
00:15:48,140 --> 00:15:52,300
♪You burn through the distance
I fought to keep♪

312
00:15:52,790 --> 00:15:55,160
♪The lamplight flickers♪

313
00:15:55,160 --> 00:15:57,600
♪Like your eyes♪

314
00:15:57,670 --> 00:16:01,100
♪Already written into my fate♪

315
00:16:16,840 --> 00:16:21,190
♪Something in my chest draws me near♪

316
00:16:21,550 --> 00:16:25,920
♪Like a silhouette, I move toward you♪

317
00:16:26,300 --> 00:16:30,720
♪The past lingers on,
yet my heart is in turmoil♪

318
00:16:31,060 --> 00:16:33,380
♪A test used as an excuse♪

319
00:16:33,380 --> 00:16:36,220
♪To stir the waters♪

320
00:16:36,220 --> 00:16:40,390
♪But the moment you come close♪

321
00:16:40,530 --> 00:16:45,260
♪You burn through the distance
I fought to keep♪

322
00:16:45,420 --> 00:16:47,760
♪The lamplight flickers♪

323
00:16:47,930 --> 00:16:50,190
♪Like your eyes♪

324
00:16:50,190 --> 00:16:54,660
♪Already written into my fate♪
